# The TUI's runtime tree, for the AppImage (#534). tools/pyproject.toml keeps the
# floor (textual>=8.2.8, tools/uv.lock); requirements.txt is the build's pin, with
# hashes, generated from this file by `tools/appimage/build.sh --refresh-requirements`.
#
# Nothing else of tools/pyproject.toml is here on purpose: omph_tui.py and tui/
# import the standard library, Textual and Rich, and nothing more (no gguf, no
# numpy, no openai).
textual>=8.2.8
